 on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-reds[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-reds: update the stale walkMode v5 and hex-guard pins [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](bob-cli-md), stop Platform shadowing from breaking platform tests [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](bob-cli-me), defuse the block-marks fixture date bomb (bob-cli-m8), and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close all three.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Never promote closed or archived prerequisites[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]closed-prereqs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after plugin-reds[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closed-prereqs: filter capture promotion seeds by graph.open, guard the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite loop, add closed/done/cancelled prerequisite tests, and close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-jh.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Narrow the highlights-scan bob_sync.lock window[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]scan-lock[dim] · [dim][/dim]after closed-prereqs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan-lock: per scan_lock, plan the library lock-free and lock only for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]intake and writes with re-validation, preserving the 9c.1 guarantee, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then resolve bob-cli-mo.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mr","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mr.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-57342cbb6c7586c5c0c3f0bf04ef2cc8","started_at":"2026-11-17T16:20:15.833346+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"c747260a38535682bbdaf6a6ccbe95e7001509b45e45a371a